<p>The Awakening and post-Awakening DLC allows players to create new characters that start at a higher level, i.e. the character generation screen does not start at level 1. This <strong class="selflink">High-Level Character Generation</strong> tutorial demonstrates how to add similar functionality to stand-alone modules.
</p>
